WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:01.089
Good morning John.

00:00:01.089 --> 00:00:03.540
Thank you for your video Monday where you
explained all the ways in which the world

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:06.970
has actually gotten a lot better in the last
15 years, which would indicate that we have

00:00:06.970 --> 00:00:10.350
the ability to make it even better in the
next 15 years.

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:12.510
But there was a problem with your video, John.

00:00:12.510 --> 00:00:18.260
It's that you made your video about good news,
and we are cognitively biased to be both disinterested

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:21.310
in and kind of skeptical of good news.

00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:25.180
Especially when that good news is so large
scale that we can't really get emotionally

00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:26.180
involved in it.

00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:28.100
It's kinda difficult to care.

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:30.050
So I'm gonna be taking a different tack, John.

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:34.521
Today, right now, as a 193 leaders throughout
the world sign on to the UN Global Goals for

00:00:34.521 --> 00:00:40.440
the next 15 years, I don't care how much better
things have gotten because they still suck!

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:42.450
I don't like outrage for outrage's sake.

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:45.590
I don't like the news getting me all riled
up about things that don't really matter that

00:00:45.590 --> 00:00:46.590
much.

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:49.470
I want to be angry that children are dying,
that gender inequality exists pretty much

00:00:49.470 --> 00:00:53.640
everywhere on Earth, that 6 million people
will die this year because they don't have

00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:54.950
access to clean water!

00:00:54.950 --> 00:00:57.360
The world is messed up.

00:00:57.360 --> 00:00:58.790
But we have a plan.

00:00:58.790 --> 00:01:02.060
There are 17 Global Goals, each with a number
of outlined distinct targets that the UN is

00:01:02.060 --> 00:01:05.570
asking every nation on Earth to help us all
achieve by 2030.

00:01:05.570 --> 00:01:09.270
And you know what the chances of us pulling
that off are if nobody cares about it?

00:01:09.270 --> 00:01:10.270
Zero, absolutely zero.

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:14.119
We basically need every person on Earth to
know about these goals because they are achievable

00:01:14.119 --> 00:01:18.250
and we can do this, but only if people hold
their governments accountable.

00:01:18.250 --> 00:01:19.310
Only if we care!

00:01:19.310 --> 00:01:22.759
So discover the joy with me, of being pissed
off for a good reason!

00:01:22.759 --> 00:01:26.090
Not in opposition of some other group of people,
but an absolute agreement with everybody on

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:27.090
Earth.

00:01:27.090 --> 00:01:28.149
Every child on Earth should go to school.

00:01:28.149 --> 00:01:29.569
No one should be hungry.

00:01:29.569 --> 00:01:31.500
No one should be in extreme poverty.

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:34.229
And corrupt governments and greed should not
stand in the way of these goals.

00:01:34.229 --> 00:01:37.599
And I don't mean to be a doom-sayer, but it's
not gonna matter if we achieve these goals

00:01:37.599 --> 00:01:41.039
if we build them on top of an unsustainable
exploitation of our planet!

00:01:41.039 --> 00:01:44.429
In order for this world to make the kind of
investments it needs to achieve these goals,

00:01:44.429 --> 00:01:45.600
we have to care.

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:46.840
We have to hold our leaders accountable.

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:51.459
And if you do care, then you kind of definitionally
have to be angry!

00:01:51.459 --> 00:01:52.459
Because it's infuriating!

00:01:52.459 --> 00:01:53.459
So get angry!

00:01:53.459 --> 00:01:57.090
Choose the Global Goal that resonates the
most with you, draw that on your face with

00:01:57.090 --> 00:01:59.770
some eyeliner or some Sharpie, I don't care!

00:01:59.770 --> 00:02:00.770
Share with all your people!

00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:03.009
Put it on your Instagrams and on your Snapchats
and Facebooks!

00:02:03.009 --> 00:02:04.809
I don't care where you put it!

00:02:04.809 --> 00:02:05.880
SHARE IT WITH THE WORLD!

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:06.880
PEOPLE HAVE TO KNOW!

00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:07.880
Did I spit on you?!

00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:09.710
Oh I'm sorry that's so unfortunate for you!

00:02:09.710 --> 00:02:10.710
GET UP!

00:02:10.710 --> 00:02:11.710
SHARE THE GLOBAL GOALS!

00:02:11.710 --> 00:02:13.230
PRINT OUT A POSTER AT GLOBALGOALS.ORG!

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:17.959
PUT IT UP IN YOUR SCHOOL CAMPUS OR YOUR OFFICE
OR AROUND YOUR TOWN OR SHOW IT TO YOUR MOM!

00:02:17.959 --> 00:02:21.629
Share this with the rest of the world because
we have gone half way and that is not far

00:02:21.629 --> 00:02:22.629
enough!

00:02:22.629 --> 00:02:23.629
Let it out with me!

00:02:23.629 --> 00:02:24.629
Feel it with me!

00:02:24.629 --> 00:02:25.820
Scream at the SPECTER OF INJUSTICE AND UNFAIRNESS!

00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:29.700
And then go to globalgoals.org, find out what
all the fuss is about, pick your favorite

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:30.700
goal.

00:02:30.700 --> 00:02:33.040
Draw it on your face or have a friend do it
'cause I found out it's actually quite hard

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:34.040
to draw something on your own face.

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:37.069
Share it, let people know what the heck's
going on, why they should know about this,

00:02:37.069 --> 00:02:41.870
and why they maybe should be a little angry
and also a little optimistic about the future

00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:43.630
of life here on Earth.

00:02:43.630 --> 00:02:45.220
John, I'll see you on Tuesday.

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:49.170
I'm honestly amazed at how far we've come,
at how much infant mortality has decreased,

00:02:49.170 --> 00:02:51.930
at how much education and access to clean
water has increased.

00:02:51.930 --> 00:02:55.959
There's a tremendous amount of good news,
but I really-- I'm not being like tongue-in-cheek

00:02:55.959 --> 00:02:56.959
in this.

00:02:56.959 --> 00:03:00.720
I'm actually, like, I think that if we're
gonna get angry about anything, this is the

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:02.129
stuff to get angry about.

00:03:02.129 --> 00:03:06.989
And it's kind of hard, because it isn't like
one thing and it doesn't feel like "argh that's

00:03:06.989 --> 00:03:09.599
so frustrating that this one thing happened."

00:03:09.599 --> 00:03:10.599
It's big!

00:03:10.599 --> 00:03:13.091
It's big and it's hard to get your mind around,
and it's impossible to believe that we can

00:03:13.091 --> 00:03:15.920
actually do stuff about this, but we can.

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:19.530
The UN exists for a reason and the Global
Goals are an actual plan, and I am really

00:03:19.530 --> 00:03:22.030
amazed by them, and really inspired by them.

00:03:22.030 --> 00:03:26.760
And I really do hope that you will be inspired,
whoever this is watching, will be inspired

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:31.670
to share this stuff with the people around
you and in your life and in your community.

00:03:31.670 --> 00:03:33.400
So yeah I'm angry, and I yelled at you.

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:38.849
I apologize for that, if it was a little freaky,
but I think that we can do this stuff.

00:03:38.849 --> 00:03:43.310
But only if we hold our leaders accountable,
and if we really want it to happen.

00:03:43.310 --> 00:03:46.719
And of all the things I want to happen most
in the world, the achievement of the Global

00:03:46.719 --> 00:03:48.499
Goals is #1 on the list.

00:03:48.499 --> 00:03:51.569
I will never be angry again if we can just
pull this off.

